From: Nick Kennedy <nick@nick-kennedy.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:04:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] kosmickrisp: map FragCoord and subsampled sampler reads
 under fdm_rate

Adds rate map decoder NIR intrinsics, emitted as MSL
rasterization_rate_map_decoder calls. Fragment shaders in FDM pipelines
convert FragCoord from physical to screen space when a rate map is
bound. Sampling through an immutable subsampled sampler maps screen
coordinates to the physical layout using the image's parameter block.

The FragCoord pass uses nir_shader_lower_instructions, since it inserts
control flow around the replacement.

AI-written commit text (biblioklept).

